              DB-->>-A: Product row
              A->>Cache: SET product:42 with jittered TTL
              A->>Lock: Release
              loop Wait with bounded backoff
                B->>Cache: GET product:42
                Cache-->>B: Value or miss
              end
              A-->>A: Return value
